{% doc %}
Emits device-visibility utility classes for a won- section root, driven by the
standard won-base `show_on_mobile` / `show_on_desktop` toggles. Absent or blank
settings are treated as visible, so this is safe to add to any section.

Pair with the `.won-hide-mobile` / `.won-hide-desktop` utilities in won-tokens.css.

@param {object} settings - A section settings object.
@example
<section class="won-section color-{{ s.color_scheme }} {% render 'won-visibility', settings: s %}">
{% enddoc %}
{%- if settings.show_on_mobile == false -%}won-hide-mobile {% endif -%}
{%- if settings.show_on_desktop == false -%}won-hide-desktop{% endif -%}
